Syntax: cast 'cleanse' <target>

The Cleanse ritual calls upon the loa to purify a victim's body of
afflictions that resist conventional cures. This powerful healing ritual
specifically targets diseases of a personal nature, including syphilis
and other maladies spread by intimate contact or dark magic.

The ritual is particularly effective against diseases caused by Death Mist
and similar curses inflicted by enemy houngans. Where ordinary cure disease
prayers fail, the cleansing ritual's direct communion with healing spirits
can succeed.

The shaman must maintain concentration throughout the casting, calling upon
benevolent loa to drive out the corruption.

See Also: CURE DISEASE, CHASE SPIRITS
